{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There\u2019s something deeply wrong with that VHS you bought online. </i> <br><i> Are you ready to uncover what\u2019s hidden inside</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/5e7aee573eb7eb96488d7a9e1401d128.poster.avif?t=1773143862\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/5e7aee573eb7eb96488d7a9e1401d128.webm?t=1773143862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/5e7aee573eb7eb96488d7a9e1401d128.mp4?t=1773143862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>shifting maze of rooms</strong>, tracking every <strong>anomaly</strong> you observe. Don\u2019t lose your way, place emergency lights to <strong>guide yourself back through the darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful. <strong>You\u2019re not alone</strong>. Entities roam these halls. Avoid them\u2026 or <strong>fight back</strong> with the few resources you\u2019ve been given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>INSIDE ENTRY_13</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br> ENTRY_13 is a <strong>survival horror</strong> experience, with mixed-media communications and an\u00a0<strong>analog horror aesthetic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run generates a new, <strong>procedurally</strong>-<strong>built</strong>\u00a0but carefully fine-tuned, map. You\u2019ll need to explore, document anomalies. Emergency lights are your only lifeline when the darkness falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/2f103c91289c7e0e17473eff29ae37e5.poster.avif?t=1773143862\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/2f103c91289c7e0e17473eff29ae37e5.webm?t=1773143862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/2f103c91289c7e0e17473eff29ae37e5.mp4?t=1773143862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's when you won't be alone anymore. Be careful and try to avoid the entities while getting back to the exit door. If spotted, you'll have some way of fighting back, even tho it is not alwyas recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, <strong>you\u2019ll slowly piece together a layered story</strong>, <strong>tape by tape</strong>, uncovering new methods of communication and multiple possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/f8f491e2bf68e3dfe523ed5433c94b6a.poster.avif?t=1773143862\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/f8f491e2bf68e3dfe523ed5433c94b6a.webm?t=1773143862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It begins with a <strong>VHS tape you purchased from a shady website</strong>. <br><strong>You play it, by playing the game</strong>.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, fragments of research files <strong>surface on your desktop</strong>, echoes of the investigation you\u2019re conducting. The VHS and your story unfold in parallel, each revealing more about the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who persist may discover hidden rewards\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/521ca4556d0174831af48f88835b0918.poster.avif?t=1773143862\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/521ca4556d0174831af48f88835b0918.webm?t=1773143862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/521ca4556d0174831af48f88835b0918.mp4?t=1773143862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps, hand-tuned for atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly observation and survival gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergency lights as both navigation and defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile inhabitants with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layered analog horror story told through VHS tapes and files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and unlockable content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~60 minutes of core gameplay per run</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930910?t=1773143862","background_raw":"http